<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Jan-June 97 coconut output up 2.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Jan-June 97 coconut output up 2.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lankan coconut output in the first six months of 1997 rose 2.1 percent year-on-year to 1.3 billion nuts, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that coconut production in the first six months of previous year was 1.273 billion nuts.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
